# 换行符统一（2026-09 架构体检 P0）
# 源码 / 文档 / 配置一律 LF；Windows 批处理保留 CRLF（cmd 对 LF 的 goto/标签处理不可靠）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产不做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.pdf binary
